{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>I'd be glad if you also checked out my other games.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/01c377c337b50f4d6764052c7a805762.avif?t=1767082050\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel devoted herself entirely to her boyfriend, who dreamed of becoming a superstar. She worked three jobs to ensure his comfortable existence while he practiced and ran from one audition to another, living off her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/c0f632c240e19c51e3b2bec948d62f5a.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terminal diagnosis and betrayal by the man she loved happened on the same day. Life is over. Or is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/27122229a3549b9d737cfa5f98537abf.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/a95704c2d8dd5ace98274abe59059924.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if there's a being in this world capable of restoring Angel's health and helping her take revenge on the selfish traitor? Great!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s one little problem\u2026 This being is a lewd, lustful succubus, obsessed with sex (preferably in massive orgies), drugs, and illegal pleasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/695b6823eb1b9fafc5161f0f475a38cf.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as payment for her help, she asks for just a little thing\u2026 control over Angel\u2019s body!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/8055a1bf7316788b18ec890475a36b97.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s no choice! She has to agree \u2014 after bargaining a bit and getting slightly more acceptable terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So now: well-mannered, kind, principled Angel is forced to share her body with a selfish, perverted, and reckless succubus who, by the way, can also modify her own body\u2026 and even Angel\u2019s\u2026 in all sorts of ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/7d38230729dbd295663651e301c476ac.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/326984925b49bf17e1fc1d88eb331136.poster.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/326984925b49bf17e1fc1d88eb331136.webm?t=1767082050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/326984925b49bf17e1fc1d88eb331136.mp4?t=1767082050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each period of the succubus\u2019s control brings Angel unpleasant surprises, problems, or even complete disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/659dfe9a4d08b3da346a7d6aea977613.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, Angel is no pushover! She knows how to stand up for herself \u2014 and even take revenge when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/446330afd0755d5e972e045d03777d6b.poster.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/446330afd0755d5e972e045d03777d6b.webm?t=1767082050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/446330afd0755d5e972e045d03777d6b.mp4?t=1767082050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you combine this chaotic life with Angel's sudden decision to become a pop superstar and get revenge in the very field where her ex least expects it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, some of the succubus\u2019s powers can help climb the career ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/a2f9c94580b23a013ef2ffb1020e43d6.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can she find common ground with her wild bodymate and get her life together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can she take revenge on her ex?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain relationships with the people she now lives with?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will she fall into a pit of lust, depravity, and uncontrolled indulgence?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s up to you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Angel's Love&quot;</strong> is a futanari erotic visual novel about the inner battle of two opposing personalities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 7000 static 4K images converted to Ultra HD for the best visual quality.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 animated sex scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7\u201310 hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many choices affect relationships with other characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings for the main story and many side stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few minigames that don\u2019t interfere with one-handed gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roaming system \u2014 move between locations freely, explore the world, and find hidden scenes and wild adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chance to become a superstar and take revenge from the top of the pop Olympus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of girls \u2014 some easy to get, some not\u2026 and even guys. Though the succubus may have her own opinion on whom to seduce.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose: walk the path of the Angel or the Demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/c45c2aef11a5078530d71facbd58a2c4.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete lewd tasks from the \u201cSuccubus\u2019s Book.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/7d282708af3e9e0760dc84770663f2a3.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with problems caused by the restless succubus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to maintain decent relations with Angel\u2019s loved ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/e2dbc7851f492a44d0072a0604f7659b.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or\u2026 corrupt them to the extreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/extras/4a8a65866b7bd8bf53604c3508b3e86f.avif?t=1767082050\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s up to you.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863000?t=1767082050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/c9132490a60c437b99fc1a96e79df676e2e5d78f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767082050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/451ef4cd92abbc45c801b224374afd5ce208095b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767082050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863000/451ef4cd92abbc45c801b224374afd5ce208095b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767082050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"note